Dear Mr. Gabriel,


Good day.


May we ask if your sample is already in a form of fiber? Or it needs to
extract first?

For fiber testing we have the following test:

1. Tensile Strength Single Strand
2. Fiber Fineness
3. Moisture Content
4. Microscopical View - Longitudinal and cross sectional


For the first two test we have a format prior to send samples to us




Warm regards,

Christy

