>
> We are Grade 12 students from Information and Communication Technology
> High School who are currently conducting an experimental study focused on
> exploring alternative fibers for textile production. Specifically, our
> research delves into the potential utilization of COGON GRASS as an
> alternative fiber for this purpose.
>
> Our group is reaching out to inquire about the processing fees associated
> with your testing facility for our experimentation process. Additionally,
> we would also like to know the pricing of testing fees to assess the fibe=
rs
> afterwards.
>
> In summary, would it be possible to provide us with detailed information
> regarding the following:
>
> 1. The processing fees involved in utilizing your facilities for the
> experimentation process involving cogon grass fiber.
>
> 2. The testing fees associated with the rigorous analysis and assessment
> of cogon grass fibers for their suitability in textile production.
>
> Moreover, should there be any specific protocols or prerequisites needed
> prior to submitting our samples or any other information concerning the
> conduct of experiments at your center, we would greatly appreciate your
> guidance on these matters.
>
> Thank you sincerely for your time and consideration in this matter. We
> eagerly anticipate your response.
>
> Respectfully,
